{"id":1130601,"name":"린·심문 I","type":"trial","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"린·심문 I","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1130601]}],"trial":{"trial_id":130601,"stage":"1단계","unlock_time":"2023-04-11 14:00:00","diary1":"디스 영화제 사건이 끝난 후, 당신은 수감자 린을 수용했다. 조사 결과, 린은 한 중학교 사건과 깊은 연관이 있었고, 당신은 속사정을 밝혀내기 위해 린을 심문하기로 했다.","diary2":"린의 말을 듣고 당신은 린이 학교에서 곤경에 빠졌다는 사실을 알게 됐고, 말을 돌려 사건은 통제할 수 없는 피해자의 저항으로 인한 것이라는 추측을 확신했다. 하지만 진실이 드러난 것에 린은 스트레스를 받아 심문은 끝낼 수밖에 없었다.\n　　당신은 그녀를 트라우마에서 벗어나도록 도와줄 방법을 생각해내야만 한다.","evidence":[{"ID":260319,"Num":1},{"ID":260321,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260320,"Num":1},{"ID":260322,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":16,"dialogue_id":230601001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":1,"dialogue_id":230601002,"next":[3]},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230601003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230601004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230601005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230601006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":6,"dialogue_id":1,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230601008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230601009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230601010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230601011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230601012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230601013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":7,"dialogue_id":230601014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230601015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230601016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230601017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230601018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230601019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230601020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230601021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230601022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course